note right
  **Key Considerations:**
  
  **Choosing Vector DB:**
  * Scale: Dataset size
  * Speed: QPS requirements
  * Accuracy: Recall needs
  * Features: Filtering, hybrid
  * Cost: Cloud vs self-hosted
  * Integration: Existing stack
  
  **Performance Tips:**
  * Use batching for inserts
  * Normalize vectors for cosine
  * Tune index parameters
  * Apply quantization
  * Use appropriate metric
  * Enable filtering
  * Monitor recall vs speed
  
  **Memory Estimation:**
  * Vectors: n × d × 4 bytes
  * HNSW: 2-3x vector size
  * IVF: 1-1.5x vector size
  * PQ: 0.1-0.3x vector size
  
  **Common Issues:**
  * Dimension mismatch
  * Wrong distance metric
  * Poor index tuning
  * Insufficient memory
  * Slow filtering
  * Cold start latency
end note

